    <string name="desktop_day_night_network_assist_warning">Opt-in only. When enabled, Telos makes a one-shot request to a public IP→geo endpoint to learn timezone and country code. Only those values (and optional coordinates for sunrise/sunset) are stored in vault desktop.properties. Your IP is not logged, there is no continuous tracking, and themes are not synced to the cloud. If the network fails, kill-switch is on, or you are offline, Telos keeps your manual timezone and shows Preference only or Failed honestly.</string>
